{"4347620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Risen Blade", "steam_appid": 4347620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/d4427025c561ef6d617ca02b84921819.poster.avif?t=1784689243\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/d4427025c561ef6d617ca02b84921819.webm?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/d4427025c561ef6d617ca02b84921819.mp4?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>FORGE YOUR BLADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risen Blade is a fast-paced hack and slash roguelike where every run tests your skill, adaptation, and build mastery. Fight relentless enemies across ever changing encounters, pushing deeper as you learn, evolve, and rise stronger with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/3f5b57b7e25544d1b53d0edffedbe74b.poster.avif?t=1784689243\" width=1080 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/3f5b57b7e25544d1b53d0edffedbe74b.webm?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/3f5b57b7e25544d1b53d0edffedbe74b.mp4?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGH-INTENSITY COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in responsive, skill driven combat where timing, positioning, and smart decisions define survival. Cut through enemy hordes, read attack patterns, and chain abilities to overcome escalating threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER THROUGH PERKS &amp; CLASSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your character through diverse Perks and Class Builds that shape how you fight each run. Focus on raw power, speed, defense, or devastating synergies that transform your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/fdd8586ce567a7d9163821a71523c241.poster.avif?t=1784689243\" width=1080 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/fdd8586ce567a7d9163821a71523c241.webm?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/fdd8586ce567a7d9163821a71523c241.mp4?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run presents new choices and challenges. Mix perks, class upgrades, and strategies to craft unique builds and adapt your approach every time you enter the fight.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/ab5cba30772c8aeba7da0b1df5228718.poster.avif?t=1784689243\" width=1080 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/ab5cba30772c8aeba7da0b1df5228718.webm?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/ab5cba30772c8aeba7da0b1df5228718.mp4?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Risen Blade, every fall is a lesson and every victory is earned. Adapt your build, master the fight, and rise stronger with each relentless run. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/d4427025c561ef6d617ca02b84921819.poster.avif?t=1784689243\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/d4427025c561ef6d617ca02b84921819.webm?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/d4427025c561ef6d617ca02b84921819.mp4?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>FORGE YOUR BLADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risen Blade is a fast-paced hack and slash roguelike where every run tests your skill, adaptation, and build mastery. Fight relentless enemies across ever changing encounters, pushing deeper as you learn, evolve, and rise stronger with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/3f5b57b7e25544d1b53d0edffedbe74b.poster.avif?t=1784689243\" width=1080 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/3f5b57b7e25544d1b53d0edffedbe74b.webm?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347620/extras/3f5b57b7e25544d1b53d0edffedbe74b.mp4?t=1784689243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIGH-INTENSITY COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in responsive, skill driven combat where timing, positioning, and smart decisions define survival. Cut through enemy hordes, read attack patterns, and chain abilities to overcome escalating threats